<main class="contact-page" id="main-content"><header class="signal-hero signal-hero--page signal-art--c"><picture class="signal-hero__field"><source media="(max-width: 48rem)" srcset="/assets/art/signal-c-720.webp?v=1.0.9"/><img alt="" height="800" loading="eager" src="/assets/art/signal-c-1920.webp?v=1.0.9" width="1920"/></picture><div class="signal-hero__inner"><p class="signal-kicker">Contact / Open channel</p><h1 class="signal-title" data-text="Contact">Contact</h1><p class="signal-lede">For thoughtful conversations about software systems, developer tools, agent workflows, publishing, and open-source work.</p></div></header><div class="contact-layout sk-container"><article class="page-content"><h2>Send the useful context first</h2>
<p>A short note with the problem, constraints, relevant links, and the kind of response you need is the fastest way to start a productive conversation.</p>
<p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#8ee6ebe2e2e1cefce1ecebfcfaeaebf8e1fceba0ede1e3"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="3159545d5d5e71435e535443455554475e43541f525e5c">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p></article><section aria-labelledby="contact-subjects-title" class="contact-subjects"><h2 id="contact-subjects-title">Useful subjects</h2><div class="contact-subjects__grid"><article><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11 10v-5h-1m8 14v-5h-1"></path><path d="M15 5.5a.5 .5 0 0 1 .5 -.5h2a.5 .5 0 0 1 .5 .5v4a.5 .5 0 0 1 -.5 .5h-2a.5 .5 0 0 1 -.5 -.5l0 -4"></path><path d="M10 14.5a.5 .5 0 0 1 .5 -.5h2a.5 .5 0 0 1 .5 .5v4a.5 .5 0 0 1 -.5 .5h-2a.5 .5 0 0 1 -.5 -.5l0 -4"></path><path d="M6 10h.01m-.01 9h.01"></path></svg><h3>Language infrastructure</h3><p>Programming languages, runtimes, package workflows, developer infrastructure, and static publishing.</p></article><article><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 19a2 2 0 1 0 4 0a2 2 0 0 0 -4 0"></path><path d="M19 7a2 2 0 1 0 0 -4a2 2 0 0 0 0 4"></path><path d="M11 19h5.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 -7h-8a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 -7h4.5"></path></svg><h3>Agent workflows</h3><p>Orchestration, evaluation, retrieval, telemetry, memory, approvals, and evidence boundaries.</p></article><article><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20h4l10.5 -10.5a2.828 2.828 0 1 0 -4 -4l-10.5 10.5v4"></path><path d="M13.5 6.5l4 4"></path><path d="M19 16v6"></path><path d="M22 19l-3 3l-3 -3"></path></svg><h3>Open-source systems</h3><p>Open-source collaboration, technical writing, ecosystem connections, and practical feedback.</p></article></div></section></div></main>
